{"about_the_game":"The Shadow Temple has been invaded by masked horrors from its depths. The other Temples have answered a call for aid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA powerful entity that calls herself Umbra has seized control of the Temple.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Five playable characters!<br />\r\n-Each character has a unique fighting style and movelist!<br />\r\n-Each movelist consists of 15-18 unique attacks!<br />\r\n-Interact with NPCs through dialogue trees, be nice, rude, or neutral!<br />\r\n-Collect artifacts that give your character various stat buffs!<br />\r\n-Timed attacks that activate when properly executing an input during a small timing window!<br />\r\n-Combo system that allows you to fight enemies with tactics!<br />\r\n-Each character has different health, move speed, range, etc!<br />\r\n-Mana system used for special attacks/abilities!<br />\r\n-Unnecessarily thick playable characters!<br />\r\n-10-20 hours of gameplay with replay value!<br />\r\n-14 levels and 4 boss levels!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/868440?t=1756243013","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/868440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756243013","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/868440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756243013","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/868440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756243013","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Contains suggestive content and violence."},"detailed_description":"The Shadow Temple has been invaded by masked horrors from its depths. The other Temples have answered a call for aid.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA powerful entity that calls herself Umbra has seized control of the Temple.<br />\r\n